[
  {
    "id": 6609295196160,
    "text": "\"Juno would have preferred a dialectical confrontation.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139200,
    "text": "\"Yeah… then they hanged her.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139201,
    "text": "\"A true Feudocrat accepts others' opinions.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139202,
    "text": "\"Distinguish opinions from bullshit.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139203,
    "text": "\"You're a comrade, what's the point of fighting?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139204,
    "text": "\"You're a comrade, why did you side with Voitsehk?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139205,
    "text": "\"Weren’t you working on your patience?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139206,
    "text": "\"Aye, can’t you tell?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139207,
    "text": "\"I’m your comrade, what the fuck are you doing?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139208,
    "text": "\"Pretty sure you’re the one who started the fight.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139209,
    "text": "\"Can’t we settle this peacefully?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139210,
    "text": "\"...No?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139211,
    "text": "\"No need to mess up your mustache for no reason…\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6609337139212,
    "text": "\"That one with the rat on his face just spoke.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237894209536,
    "text": "\"Voitsehk is a dick, don't waste energy on him.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375360,
    "text": "\"Why do you always have to defend him!?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375361,
    "text": "\"Go back to your room, I'll deal with him.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375362,
    "text": "\"But you've never even managed to make him clean the house.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375363,
    "text": "\"You almost killed him, don't you think that's enough?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375364,
    "text": "\"I'm tired of hearing him spit poison about OUR fiefdom!\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375365,
    "text": "\"Maybe I can make you back off with a few tallies.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375366,
    "text": "\"Do I strike you as a woman of ill repute?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375367,
    "text": "\"One hand washes the other, if you catch my meaning.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375368,
    "text": "\"Are you attempting to bribe me, or merely flirting?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375369,
    "text": "\"I shall deal with Voitsehk myself; my hand is gentler than yours.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375370,
    "text": "\"One can feel a certain… stir of desire in the air.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375371,
    "text": "\"Would you have me fetch the DCB?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375372,
    "text": "\"Most tediously centrist thing I’ve ever heard.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375373,
    "text": "\"You know I love you, right?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375374,
    "text": "\"And you show it by protecting that Yellow?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375375,
    "text": "\"There's love in you, don't repress it.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375376,
    "text": "\"You smoked a joint, didn't you?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375377,
    "text": "\"I don't want to fight, the war outside is enough for me.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375378,
    "text": "\"Try putting a flower on a cannon and see what happens.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375379,
    "text": "\"Your noble intentions are betrayed by your execution.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375380,
    "text": "\"Stop behaving like that; I cannot understand you!\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375381,
    "text": "\"Allow me to enter; I can mend you.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375382,
    "text": "\"Gay.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375383,
    "text": "\"We are brothers; we are glue.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375384,
    "text": "\"You’ve sniffed all the remaining glue.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375385,
    "text": "\"You will never be able to break the love I bear for you.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375386,
    "text": "\"I shall content myself with a few broken bones, then.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375387,
    "text": "\"You fight as ungracefully as a narwhal.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375388,
    "text": "\"Fuck off!\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375389,
    "text": "\"I'll fuck you with sand!\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375390,
    "text": "\"What?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375391,
    "text": "\"Show respect to your Vice Condo-Chief!\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375392,
    "text": "\"You don't deserve that title!\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375393,
    "text": "\"Have you put on weight?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375394,
    "text": "\"What the fuck do you want!?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375395,
    "text": "\"At your age, all this physical exertion does you no good.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375396,
    "text": "\"I shall wipe your blood upon my handkerchief.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375397,
    "text": "\"Haven’t you washed yourself since you immigrated here?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375398,
    "text": "\"My family tree has roots deeper than yours!\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375399,
    "text": "\"Do you wish to use the people’s taxes for your hospital?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11237919375400,
    "text": "\"I would rather pay for your morgue.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961536,
    "text": "\"Let me guess, Voitsehk attacked your propaganda.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961537,
    "text": "\"Propaganda, the magic word to downplay everything.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961538,
    "text": "\"I'm not a big fan of fighting among the oppressed.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961539,
    "text": "\"Please stop randomly quoting books.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961540,
    "text": "\"Are you punching the clock like a good servant today too?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961541,
    "text": "\"Are you campaigning or talking to me?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961542,
    "text": "\"I see that today, too, you are barren of opinions.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961543,
    "text": "\"You know how it is; I do not wish to waste time.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961544,
    "text": "\"The telly divides us; how can you not see it?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961545,
    "text": "\"All that I know, I saw it in prime time.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961546,
    "text": "\"Once I was blind as you are; then I began to read books.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961547,
    "text": "\"The Sporting Almanac is not a book.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961548,
    "text": "\"I carry knowledge in my pocket…  and I am not afraid to use it.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961549,
    "text": "\"My library is more extensive than yours.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961550,
    "text": "\"Let's pretend it never happened, comrade?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961551,
    "text": "\"Alright… there's no point in continuing.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961552,
    "text": "\"Let's pretend it never happened, comrade?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13704144961553,
    "text": "\"Don't you dare call me comrade!\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4028101616025600,
    "text": "\"Is it you?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4028101662162944,
    "text": "\"W-where did you get that!?\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  }
]